sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A as Orchestrator A
  participant DB as workflow schema
  participant P as Provider gRPC
  participant B as Orchestrator B

  A->>DB: Claim submitting_create with fence 7
  DB-->>A: Lease + persisted trace context
  A->>P: SubmitCreateInstance with stable request ID
  P-->>A: Resource ID + provider task reference
  A->>DB: Commit polling_create + task reference + next trace context

  A->>DB: Claim polling_create with fence 8
  A->>P: GetTask(task reference)
  Note over A,DB: Process terminates before the next checkpoint commits.
  A-xDB: Connection closes and lease remains until expiry

  DB->>DB: Lease expires
  B->>DB: Claim polling_create with fence 9
  DB-->>B: Existing resource + task + trace context
  B->>P: GetTask(same task reference)
  P-->>B: Succeeded
  B->>DB: Commit observing_ownership under fence 9

  A-xDB: Late fence 8 write is rejected
  B->>P: ObserveResource(resource ID)
  P-->>B: Owned + active
  B->>DB: Commit completed + terminal outbox facts

  Note over A,B: Recovery resumes durable work and never holds a Kafka record or creates a second VM.
